Algorithms and where they are implemented from
----------------------------------------------

Each is written from the paper named here; the docstring where it is
implemented cites the paper and states any departure from it.

  Model
  QARepVGG block                 Chu et al. 2022, arXiv 2212.01593
  Zero-initialised residuals     Goyal et al. 2017, arXiv 1706.02677
  Feature Pyramid Grid           Chen et al. 2020, arXiv 2004.03580
  CSP / ELAN dense aggregation   Wang et al. 2019, arXiv 1911.11929;
                                 Wang et al. 2024, arXiv 2402.13616
  Decoupled detection head       Ge et al. 2021 (YOLOX), arXiv 2107.08430
  Dynamic mask kernels           Tian et al. 2020 (CondInst), arXiv 2003.05664;
                                 Lyu et al. 2022 (RTMDet), arXiv 2212.07784
  Keypoint heatmaps and snapping Zhou et al. 2019 (CenterNet), arXiv 1904.07850

  Training
  TOOD task alignment            Feng et al. 2021, arXiv 2108.07755
  ATSS                           Zhang et al. 2020, arXiv 1912.02424
  ATSS warmup into TAL           Li et al. 2022 (YOLOv6), arXiv 2209.02976
  Distribution Focal Loss        Li et al. 2020, arXiv 2006.04388
  Complete IoU                   Zheng et al. 2020, arXiv 1911.08287
  Varifocal loss                 Zhang et al. 2020, arXiv 2008.13367
  Mosaic                         Bochkovskiy et al. 2020, arXiv 2004.10934
  mixup                          Zhang et al. 2017, arXiv 1710.09412
  Cosine learning-rate schedule  Loshchilov & Hutter 2016, arXiv 1608.03983
  Muon orthogonalised update     K. Jordan 2024, public description
  Object Keypoint Similarity     COCO keypoint evaluation definition
